<title>UK: Crediop unit sets 300 bln lire five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Crediop unit sets 300 bln lire five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Istituto Bancario San Paolo di Torino.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIOP OVERSEAS BANK LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CREDIOP SPA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.10    FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.90</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
